==Trivia==
*The [[wikipedia:Eskimo Nebula|Eskimo Nebula]] is a real location, named for its resemblance to a person wearing a parka.
*This stage has a different name in both console platforms, "Nebula" in the [[The Battle Cats POP!|3DS Version]] and CAT-2392 in the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Switch Version.]]
**CAT-2392 is a pun on the real Eskimo Nebula's designation, NGC 2392. The name change may have been to avoid any controversy involving the term ''Eskimo'', which is regarded as downright offensive by many Inuit, Yupik, Aleut and other such individuals.

